OL,3,C'Significant' number of firefighters
OL,4,Crespond to large fire in Cannock Chase
OL,6,FDozens of firefighters are at the
OL,7,Fscene of a large fire in Cannock Chase.
OL,9,FA total of 15 fire engines were sent
OL,10,Fto the area off Chase Road, close to
OL,11,FCoppice Hill and Brocton, at around
OL,12,F2.30pm on Wednesday.
OL,14,FIt is after a report of smoke coming
OL,15,Ffrom the area.
