OL,3,C'Significant' number of firefighters
OL,4,Crespond to large fire in Cannock Chase
OL,6,FStaffordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid a "significant" number of
OL,8,Ffirefighters are responding to the
OL,9,Ffire, using water carriers, hose reel
OL,10,Fjets, main jets, and a high-volume
OL,11,Fpump.
OL,13,FPeople are being asked to avoid the
OL,14,Farea and keep windows and doors closed.
